  			<head xml:id="pll2d14c1-Hd1e3516" type="questionTitle">De opere secundae diei, qua factum est firmamentum</head>
  			<p xml:id="pll2d14c1-d1e3519">
  				<cit>
  					<quote xml:id="pll2d14c1-Qd1e3523" source="http://scta.info/resource/gen1_6@1-13 http://scta.info/resource/gen1_7@5-16"><!-- and gen1_7 -->Dixit quoque Deus: fiat firmamentum in medio aquarum, 
